==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Snache]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lost World Yuki (Enemy)|Lost World Yuki]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Takuya (Enemy)|Takuyas]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Takuya (Enemy)|Takuyas]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring a few meatshields along with a good attacker and you should be all set.

